coder v0.0.0-devel

USAGE:
  coder rename [flags] <workspace> <new name>

  Rename a workspace

    - Rename a workspace without a confirmation prompt:
  
       $ coder rename <workspace> <new name> --yes

OPTIONS:
  -y, --yes bool
          Bypass confirmation prompts.

———
Run `coder --help` for a list of global options.
